    "chat": {
      "_comment": "Floating in-world comms window — the flicker-widgets `chat_panel` builder (a per-frame Rust UiNode tree the pocclusters scene runs as a SECOND run_ui pass over the HUD, so the window can move + resize; not a cached tree). Maps the DesignSync ChatPanel (MCP 36F7946B) onto the clay-chat v0.1 line protocol (MCP D9FE6CE0). Container leaves (window/titlebar/tabstrip/tab_*/log/roster/input_bar/btn*) are panel styles (fill_top/fill_bot/border/radius); *_color + line_* + roster_* are TEXT colours (a text node's dotted `color` path). `input` is the text_field style (top/bot/border/caret/placeholder/label). Single palette: every value is a $token from theme.tokens.",
